Version 0.32.0

- Migration to Avalonia 12
- Restructured platform API, platform layout implemented
- Lines and text annotations in layout controls
- Full support of cytometer preference, mass cytometry and spectral cytometry
- Normalization of time and batches by multi-element beads
- Index demultiplexer
- Various convenience functions

Patch 7

- Deleting gates no longer request recalculation
- Fix DPI-awareness of table rendering error

Patch 10

- Enable refresh of the compensation preview